(7738222, 1275830, 173844, '<td valign="top">That''s a long road.  And a sign!  Still, the wonderful expanse casts the spell.  I like the muted palette, the serenity, the overall painterly feel.  The composition falls right into place.  Casually beautiful.</td>', 'That''s a long road.  And a sign!  Still, the wonderful expanse casts the spell.  I like the muted palette, the serenity, the overall painterly feel.  The composition falls right into place.  Casually beautiful.', '2023-02-09 20:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7738223, 1275622, 68504, '<td valign="top">the ministry of silly walks and a peaceful moment in dog training. what could be better? (and now I have to vote, darn it all).</td>', 'the ministry of silly walks and a peaceful moment in dog training. what could be better? (and now I have to vote, darn it all).', '2023-02-09 21:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7738224, 1275693, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nicely presented, the sleek car forging into the messy uncertainties of wind and rain.<br/>Changed traffic conditions ahead, indeed.  Like in a video game, the viewer feels like the driver, which can induce a moment of panic for those used to driving on the right hand side of the road.  An oncoming truck is bearing down on me!  Whew, that''s too close.  Rewarding, intimate scene.</td>', 'Nicely presented, the sleek car forging into the messy uncertainties of wind and rain.Changed traffic conditions ahead, indeed.  Like in a video game, the viewer feels like the driver, which can induce a moment of panic for those used to driving on the right hand side of the road.  An oncoming truck is bearing down on me!  Whew, that''s too close.  Rewarding, intimate scene.', '2023-02-09 21:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
