(7738475, 1275644, 29535, '<td valign="top">This was quite the surprise, as I almost scrapped the photo due to the difficulty I had pulling it together for the submission as the lighting was challenging and it was quite a rush to get the shot. Goes to show that when in doubt always make sure to submit something, you never know who it will resonate with. Thanks everyone!</td>', 'This was quite the surprise, as I almost scrapped the photo due to the difficulty I had pulling it together for the submission as the lighting was challenging and it was quite a rush to get the shot. Goes to show that when in doubt always make sure to submit something, you never know who it will resonate with. Thanks everyone!', '2023-02-14 07:01:46.000000', NULL, 0);
